# --- Reels ---------------------------------------------------
# Nothing to add here. /category/reels reads the `reels` table with
# the same anon key as everything else, and migration 0014 already
# opened public select on it. The reels are fetched by the Python
# ingestion worker — see ENABLE_REELS and the provider keys in
# apps/ingestion/.env.example. An empty page there means the worker
# has not been switched on, not a missing secret here.
